{"speciesId":138,"names":{"fr":"Amonita","es":"Omanyte","en":"Omanyte","ja":"オムナイト"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Although long extinct, in rare cases, it can be genetically resurrected from fossils."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Although long extinct, in rare cases, it can be genetically resurrected from fossils."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"An ancient POKéMON that was recovered from a fossil. It swims by cleverly twisting its 10 tentacles about."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Revived from an ancient fossil, this POKéMON uses air stored in its shell to sink and rise in water."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"This POKéMON from ancient times is said to have navi­ gated the sea by adeptly twisting its 10 tentacles."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"In prehistoric times, it swam on the sea floor, eating plankton. Its fossils are sometimes found."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"OMANYTE is one of the ancient and long- since-extinct POKéMON that have been regenerated from fossils by people. If attacked by an enemy, it withdraws itself inside its hard shell."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"OMANYTE is one of the ancient and long- since-extinct POKéMON that have been regenerated from fossils by people. If attacked by an enemy, it withdraws itself inside its hard shell."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"One of the ancient and long-since-extinct POKéMON that have been regenerated from fossils by humans. If attacked, it withdraws into its hard shell."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"A prehistoric POKéMON that lived in the primordial sea, it swims by twisting its 10 tentacles about."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Although long extinct, in rare cases, it can be genetically regenerated from fossils."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Revived from an ancient fossil, this Pokémon uses air stored in its shell to sink and rise in water."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"This Pokémon from ancient times is said to have navigated the sea by adeptly twisting its 10 tentacles."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon ramené à la vie par la science à partir d’un fossile. Il peuplait autrefois les mers."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un Pokémon ramené à la vie par la science à partir d’un fossile. Il peuplait autrefois les mers."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon préhistorique qui vivait dans les profondeurs marines. Il se déplace en agitant ses 10 tentacules."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon prehistórico que vivió en el océano primordial. Para nadar se valía de sus 10 tentáculos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A prehistoric Pokémon that lived in the primordial sea, it swims by twisting its 10 tentacles about."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大昔 海に 住んでいた 古代ポケモン。１０本の 脚を くねらせて 泳ぐ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Recréé à partir d’un fossile, il utilise l’air dans sa coquille pour s’enfoncer dans l’eau ou faire surface."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Resucitado de un fósil, este Pokémon usa el aire de su concha para sumergirse y emerger."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Revived from an ancient fossil, this Pokémon uses air stored in its shell to sink and rise in water."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"古代の 化石から 復活。 殻の 中に ためた 空気で 水中を 浮き沈みしていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Amonita est l’un des Pokémon disparus depuis longtemps et qui furent ressuscités à partir de fossiles. Lorsqu’il est attaqué par un ennemi, il se rétracte dans sa coquille."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Omanyte es uno de esos Pokémon ancestrales que se extinguieron hace muchísimo tiempo y que la gente ha recuperado a partir de fósiles. Si un enemigo le ataca, se esconderá dentro de la dura concha que tiene."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Omanyte is one of the ancient and long-since-extinct Pokémon that have been regenerated from fossils by people. If attacked by an enemy, it withdraws itself inside its hard shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大昔に 絶滅したが 人間の 手で 化石から 復活させた ポケモンの 一つ。 敵に 襲われると 硬い カラに 隠れる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Amonita est l’un des Pokémon disparus depuis longtemps et qui furent ressuscités à partir de fossiles. Lorsqu’il est attaqué par un ennemi, il se rétracte dans sa coquille."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Omanyte es uno de esos Pokémon ancestrales que se extinguieron hace muchísimo tiempo y que la gente ha recuperado a partir de fósiles. Si un enemigo le ataca, se esconderá dentro de la dura concha que tiene."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Omanyte is one of the ancient and long-since-extinct Pokémon that have been regenerated from fossils by people. If attacked by an enemy, it withdraws itself inside its hard shell."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"大昔に 絶滅したが 人間の 手で 化石から 復活させた ポケモンの 一つ。 敵に 襲われると 硬い カラに 隠れる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un Pokémon qui vivait dans les mers antiques. Des fossiles présentant des traces de morsures indiquent qu’il était la proie d’Aéroptéryx."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Pokémon prehistórico que vivía en el océano. Las marcas de mordeduras en sus fósiles indican que solía ser presa de los Archeops."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Omanyte lived in the seas of antiquity. Its fossils have been found bearing bite marks from Archeops, so apparently Archeops preyed on it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"古代の海に 生きていた ポケモン。 アーケオスの エサだったようで 歯型のついた 化石が 見つかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Un Pokémon recréé à partir d’un fossile antique. Ces Nautiles se trouvent en des endroits jadis recouverts par les flots."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Este Pokémon ha sido regenerado a partir de Fósiles Hélix hallados en estratos que corresponden al lecho de océanos prehistóricos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It was restored from an ancient fossil. Those Helix Fossils are excavated from areas that were once oceans long, long ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"古代の 化石から 復元された。 大昔 海だった 場所から かいのカセキが 発掘 される。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Un ancien Pokémon reconstitué à partir d’un fossile. Il nageait dans les mers antiques grâce à ses dix tentacules."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Este antiguo Pokémon fue regenerado a partir de un fósil. Solía nadar en antiguos mares moviendo con destreza sus 10 tentáculos."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"An ancient Pokémon that was recovered from a fossil. It swam by cleverly twisting its 10 tentacles about."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"１０本の足を うまく くねらせて 古代の 海を 漂っていた ポケモンの カセキを 復元した。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Un ancien Pokémon reconstitué à partir d’un fossile. Il nageait dans les mers antiques grâce à ses dix tentacules."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Este antiguo Pokémon fue regenerado a partir de un fósil. Solía nadar en antiguos mares moviendo con destreza sus 10 tentáculos."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"An ancient Pokémon that was recovered from a fossil. It swam by cleverly twisting its 10 tentacles about."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"１０本の足を うまく くねらせて 古代の 海を 漂っていた ポケモンの カセキを 復元した。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon commence à poser problème, car certains spécimens se sont enfuis ou ont été relâchés après avoir été ressuscités."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Varios ejemplares han escapado o bien han sido liberados tras su restauración, lo que comienza a suscitar una serie de problemas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Because some Omanyte manage to escape after being restored or are released into the wild by people, this species is becoming a problem."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"復元されたあと 逃げだしたり 逃がしてしまう ものが いるため 問題に なりつつあるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Un Pokémon préhistorique aujourd’hui disparu. Il semble flotter lorsqu’il nage en brassant l’eau avec ses dix tentacules."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Un Pokémon de la era prehistórica, ahora extinto. Solía nadar moviendo sus diez tentáculos para desplazarse por el agua como si flotara."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon is a member of an ancient, extinct species. Omanyte paddles through water with its 10 tentacles, looking like it’s just drifting along."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"絶滅した 古代のポケモン。 １０本の脚で 水を かき 漂うように 泳ぐ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":138,"moves":[{"name":"bind","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]}